 "title": "Unidirectional 5 V ESD protection diode, ultra-low capacitance, SOD-523",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev:2.0",
  "pages": 3
 },
 "summary": "A single unidirectional ESD and surge suppressor in the SOD-523 surface-mount package, with 0.6 pF typical and 0.8 pF maximum junction capacitance. It stands off 5 V, breaks down between 6.0 V and 9.0 V at 1 mA, and clamps to 15 V at most while carrying its rated 5 A of 8/20 µs surge. It withstands ±25 kV air and ±20 kV contact discharge under IEC 61000-4-2. Uses named for it are handsets and accessories, PDAs, notebooks and handhelds, portable instruments and digital cameras, peripherals, audio players and industrial equipment.",
